WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.450
Someone once said...

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:54.490
There is a bamboo thicket which produces

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:58.760
a colorful selection of sashimi, like 
tuna, sea bream, octopus, and salmon...

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.830
The Bamboo Sushicket!

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:06.730
There is a male chameleon 
which produces a sweet,

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.970
fragrant flavor of high-grade 
melon to attract females...

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:14.310
The Male Chamelon!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:18.310
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:23.280
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.050
Toriko and the others headed 
to the Gourmet Pyramid

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:30.390
to get their hands on the 
legendary Mellow Cola.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:33.290
They managed to extract the 
cola from the Salamander Sphinx

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.260
thanks to Komatsu's careful instructions.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.970
But the cola was stolen 
by a mysterious creature!

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:43.370
Against the overwhelming 
power of this creature

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:47.370
Zebra used his power of anger, 
while Toriko used autophagy.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.480
Toriko and Zebra's combination 
techniques burst forth!

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:55.580
They safely defeated the mysterious 
creature and got the Mellow Cola!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:03:00.890
I'm putting this Mellow 
Cola on my Full Course.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.860
How about it, kid?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.390
With that set, you'll be my partner, yeah?

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:16.840
The Truth Revealed! Komatsu's Will and 
the Identity of the Mysterious Creature!

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.480
What do you mean, partner?

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:31.880
But we came here, as a condition for 
Zebra-san to help us capture the Mellow Cola...

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:35.150
I got one last condition.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.420
When we do get the Mellow Cola,

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:42.160
you gotta become my partner.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.930
But I...

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:48.600
You're a better match for me than Toriko.

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:54.140
No two ways about it, you an' me 
could make the strongest combo ever.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:59.280
In that case, I have one condition!

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.280
You have to tell me your Full Course of Life!

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:09.750
Let me decide whether to be your partner or 
not after I see your Full Course ingredients!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.620
Full Course...

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.890
I ain't got one...

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.700
Whaaat?!

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.270
Yeah, ain't thought 'bout it, either.

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:29.040
I thought all Gourmet Hunters were 
trying to fill out their Full Course...

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.610
Don't lump me together with those guys.

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:34.810
I'm lookin' for tasty food, that's all.

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.110
Anything else ain't worth my time.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:40.220
That's all a Gourmet Hunter needs, right?

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.750
Toriko-san...

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:49.120
Toriko-san's Full Course isn't complete yet.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:54.260
But... But I think it'll 
be something to behold!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:05:00.000
I want to prepare those ingredients 
myself, as only I can do!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.000
That's why I decided to 
partner with Toriko-san.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:07.080
I cannot decide whether 
to be your partner or not

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.280
without looking at your 
Full Course, Zebra-san!

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:14.780
So, you're tellin' me I gotta put 
up a Full Course to beat Toriko's?

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:19.950
Right. And until then, 
I'm Toriko-san's partner!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:26.890
Sounds good to me! I'll gather the 
ultimate Full Course, just you wait!

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.530
And that's basically what happened...

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:36.070
Wait, you two! Don't go 
deciding things like that!

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:37.970
How 'bout it, huh?

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:41.910
Likin' this Mellow Cola on my Full Course?

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:45.310
Um... I can't really just 
decide based on the Drink....

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:46.750
What?!

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.420
S-Sorry...

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.480
Toriko's missin' a bunch too, you know!

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:55.050
I bet your Full Course is full 
of crappy ingredients, yeah!

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.260
What do you mean, crappy?!

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:58.560
Oh, yeah?

00:05:58.560 --> 00:05:59.460
Oh, yeah!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.260
Betcha break down in tears if ya ate 'em!

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.860
Hell, no I wouldn't!

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.900
Oh yeah you would!

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.500
Um... Anyways...

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.430
What?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.430
What?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.340
I can't decide on whether 
to by Zebra-san's partner

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:13.570
until both of your Full Courses are complete.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:16.340
You tryin' to play me, kid?!

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:19.780
Yeah! I can't believe you'd 
promise that without telling me!

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:24.080
I'm sorry... But, please understand.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:29.790
The reason I said that condition 
without any second thoughts,

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.060
is because I believe in you, Toriko-san!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:37.530
I believe that your Full Course 
won't be outdone by anyone!

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:38.760
Komatsu...

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.470
That's some trust you got there.

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:48.270
Fine then! I'll let it slide this time.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:54.150
But I'll gather up a Full Course that'll 
make you take it all back in no time!

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:55.780
Zebra-san!

00:06:55.780 --> 00:07:00.320
We got the cola, so let's hoof it on back!

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:05.320
You're gonna take charge of preparin' 
the food for the banquet!

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.460
Right! I'll gladly cook with all I've got!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.030
Oh, a natural rubber sack!

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:19.040
Yup! It's a Gourmet Case for liquids!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.870
Leave it to me!

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:27.010
Toriko-san!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.790
Gotta take this guy back, too.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:39.020
Fry 'em and eat 'em?

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.060
Come on!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.760
He's on your Full Course, right?

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:52.530
Salamander Sphinx...

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:55.870
Your tears are on Zebra's Full Course!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.340
Thanks!

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:05.880
Once your cola is mellowed, we'll be back!

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.050
It's angry!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.120
Run away!

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:16.460
Zebra, why're you walking?!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.770
I-Is that...?

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:28.740
Zebra-sama!

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:29.870
Zebra-sama?

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:30.770
Zebra-sama!

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:32.440
Zebra-sama!

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:37.210
You guys are such a pest! Move it!

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:42.780
Oh, you two came back?

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:47.820
I'm so glad you are safe! You actually 
got back safely from the Gourmet Pyramid!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:48.560
Yes...

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.460
It sure was hot, though...

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:10.740
But Zebra-san protected me with cooling 
carbonation armor from the cola.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.650
That's how I managed to get through it.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.050
We didn't just get through it.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:20.550
We also picked up natural rice 
and raw sugar from the desert.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.990
This is for letting us borrow the camels.

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.620
Everyone, eat up!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:29.300
Together with the legendary 
cola, Mellow Cola!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:34.900
How'd this turn into them drinkin' the cola?

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:37.270
Think before you say things, Toriko!

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:39.370
We got plenty, what's the big deal?

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.580
You brought that book with you?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:51.420
Yes. I thought I could research it.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:56.490
I get this feeling like it was 
fate to discover this book.

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.520
My fate as a chef.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:03.830
This is the legacy of food, 
left by an ancient people...

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:10.740
I'm sure I can make new discoveries 
and learn new things from this book.

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.900
Learn from history, as they say!

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:17.070
I bet this book will be the key 
to a new era of the Gourmet Age.

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.680
I see.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:28.620
I'm bored. Let's fight!

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.950
I'l tellin' you I don't wanna!

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:34.690
And you're bored? It's barely 
been 30 minutes since we left!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.060
What, you tryin' to pick a fight?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:39.060
That's what <i>you're</i> doin'!

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.330
You liar! It's been 31 minutes!

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:43.330
How's that any different?!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.730
What, you gettin' cocky with me?!

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:48.340
Sheesh... Is this gonna 
go on for another month?

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.940
No, I ain't!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.770
Oh, yeah?

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:12.730
Thank you, Gourmet Pyramid...

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.900
Bye-bye, Sand Garden.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:46.790
He's really here!

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:50.330
Zebra's come here!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.800
Get the customers to safety!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:00.510
Lively in here, huh?

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:02.210
That's all your fault, you know.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:04.310
Welcome! I've been waiting.

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:05.650
Hey, Komatsu.

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:08.750
Just like I promised, I've 
prepared my best dishes

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.990
to celebrate your capture of the Mellow Cola.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.090
Hey...

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.060
Don't get cocky, kid!

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.790
Let's get this party started already!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.660
Where's the hall at?

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.830
Did I get cocky about something?

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.930
He's just puttin' it on 
'cause he's embarrassed.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:31.340
Ever since he ate your cooking when 
he was released from Honey Prison,

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:33.170
he's been a fan of yours.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.540
What? Really?

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:40.380
Shaddup 'bout that already!

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:41.580
What the hell are you doing?!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.780
Shut up! I'll bust you up!

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:47.690
Will you two please stop!?

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:52.760
That's Zebra, one of the Four Kings...

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.060
Tina-san!

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:56.660
Komatsu-kun, it's been so long!

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:02.600
Chef Komatsu, you've sure invited 
quite the guest again...

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.640
Now then, with this Mellow Cola...

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.670
With this Mellow Cola...

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:08.670
Cheers!

00:13:14.910 --> 00:13:16.180
Delicious!

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:19.620
It's been a month, but the 
carbonation hasn't dulled one bit!

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:23.720
The fizz dancing in my mouth is heaven!

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.960
Not just my throat, but in my stomach too!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:30.190
It tickles my gullet and whets my appetite!

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:35.070
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty! Let's eat!

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:39.870
Yum!

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:48.080
Bring all the dishes as they're finished!

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:56.750
W-What an incredible appetite!

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.290
This is awesome!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:13.470
Even after I procured extra 
ingredients from other hotels...

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:14.840
...they finished off everything!

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:19.110
Thanks for the food, Komatsu. Never better.

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:20.880
Thank you very much!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:23.610
How was it, Zebra-san?

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:26.980
Kid... You didn't serve that, did you?

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:31.120
I thought I told you to fry it up for me.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:37.160
It didn't seem like something you'd 
want to eat after I prepared it...

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:38.960
We're taking charge of it.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.200
Chief Mansom!

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:42.760
What? Did you just call me handsome?

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.100
No, he didn't.

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:49.000
You're...

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:53.270
I am the IGO Defense Bureau Chief, Ray.

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.410
Two Bureau Chiefs?

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:59.150
Please, no video.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.650
Everyone other than us, leave the room.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:08.390
Wait! Give me back my camera!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:13.560
What's the deal showing up like this?

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:17.460
You know something about that creature?

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:20.200
We came to take it so we could research it.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:25.570
It's in the kitchen, yes?

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:28.140
U-Um...

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:32.250
Hold it, buddy. That's my catch.

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:36.820
Stop. You can't win.

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:41.620
His name is Rapp. He works at Biotope #0.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:46.830
#0?! Aren't there only 
Biotopes #1 through #8?

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:49.530
Yeah. In the Human World, that is.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:50.030
Huh?

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.400
Biotope #0 is in the Gourmet World.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.770
An IGO research facility 
is in the Gourmet World?!

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:00.870
Which means he's overcome the 
environment of the Gourmet World...

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:04.340
Didn't think the IGO still had 
anyone with such skills...

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:07.480
No, he's not a member of the IGO.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.310
Huh?

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:12.280
The workers at Biotope #0 
are all private citizens,

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.520
hand picked by the President 
for their skills.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:15.920
Private citizens?

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:19.090
Yes. They all have different 
jobs in the Human World.

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.760
They're the best of the best.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:27.100
Cutler Melk and Gourmet Reviver Yosaku 
are actually workers at Biotope #0.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:29.270
Melk-san and Yosaku-san, too?

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.640
Yosaku?!

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:35.070
You know how strong Yosaku is, don't you?

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:40.880
So you're with Yosaku, are ya?

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:44.080
Perfect! Bring it on!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:52.920
Please stop. I will not 
escape this uninjured.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.160
Being honest, aren't you?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:59.630
Sounds like you're the liar here, Chief!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:04.840
When Toriko asked if you knew 
something about that creature,

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:09.310
your voice gave away your rising 
pulse and blood pressure.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.670
The Devil's ears, indeed.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:12.680
Chief...

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.140
Please.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:24.320
Tell us. Komatsu and I 
saw one in the sky, too.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.120
What in the world are they?

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.830
They are called the Nitro.

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:34.200
It's said that Gourmet God Acacia 
discovered and named them.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:35.460
Nitro?

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:38.870
Species unclassified... We 
don't know how they reproduce.

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:42.970
We don't know when they 
appeared on the planet,

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:48.780
but we've discovered petrified remains from 
strata hundreds of millions of years old.

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:53.720
Hundreds of millions of years? You 
mean when dinosaurs were still around?

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:58.620
Yes. The scariest aspect of 
the Nitro is their life force.

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:00.690
Even if the environment goes bad,

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:04.890
they can dehydrate their body and 
hibernate in a mummified state,

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.760
and persist for thousands of years...

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:09.730
Then, the one in the pyramid was also...?

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.130
Most likely.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.870
There are records of Nitro waking 
up after being given liquids

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:18.940
even after sleeping in a mummified 
state for thousands of years.

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:23.640
Then, it's because of the ground water 
I spread around with my Melk Knife...

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:25.310
That's why?

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:30.180
And that's not all. You should 
know, having faced it.

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:33.350
You should know how frighteningly 
fierce they are.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:34.790
Fierce?

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:40.330
They charge right in no matter what they're 
facing. A ferocious and vicious creature...

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:45.400
Just like nitroglycerin, ready to explode 
with just the slightest provocation.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.930
Oh, so that's why they're called the Nitro?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.370
Sounds like they got the right idea to me!

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:53.670
All the prey out there 
these days is too weak!

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:56.310
They're not simply fierce.

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:59.210
The Nitro's high level of 
intelligence is a unique feature.

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:03.250
We've discovered a number 
of their ancient ruins.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.950
Then, that means...

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:09.050
Yes. Our investigations 
are far from complete,

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:12.760
but we know that the Gourmet Pyramid is 
part of their civilization, for example.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.190
I can see that.

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:20.230
They learned how to eat the Ozone Grass and 
my Spiked Punch after seeing them once.

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:25.400
Their intelligence is surely high enough 
to know how to cook ingredients.

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:26.710
Cook?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:32.680
Their incredible appetite and Gourmet 
taste surely surpasses us humans.

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:37.920
So those cooking techniques painted on 
the walls and in that book are from them?

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.850
For your information...

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:52.330
Another one seems to have 
left the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:55.270
This has never been discovered before.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.930
There were other ones?

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:59.270
I don't get it, Chief.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:03.840
We got two Bureau Chiefs and 
a worker from Biotope #0 here!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:06.440
You gotta be hidin' somethin'!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.790
The Gourmet Corp. is involved.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.960
The Gourmet Corp.? Why?

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:25.500
The Nitro have been searching out delicious 
ingredients since antiquity just by instinct.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:30.570
They know how to obtain GOD!

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.170
G-GOD, you say?

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:38.770
The Legendary Ingredient! The 
Main Dish of Gourmet God Acacia?

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.640
Chief, that's saying too much.

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:44.750
Now, now. We're going to need the 
power of the Four Kings, after all.

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:47.880
The boss of the Gourmet Corp., Midora...

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:51.450
He'd trying to take control of 
all the world's ingredients,

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.790
using them as bait to 
get closer to the Nitro.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.890
That's also why the GT Robots resemble them.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:06.130
It's clear that the Gourmet Corp. is 
already using the Nitro for some plan.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:13.610
Even if that's not the case, their sudden 
activity is proof that a solar eclipse is coming soon.

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:16.610
A new Gourmet War will erupt.

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:18.910
War?

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:25.750
If I get my hands on GOD, then all I 
need to do is share it with everyone.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:30.590
If I do that, then there won't be any war.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.600
And that's exactly what I'm gonna do!

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:43.370
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.210
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:51.950
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:54.780
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:57.620
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:00.450
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:03.190
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:05.990
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.700
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:10.360
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:22:10.360 --> 00:22:11.800
and it'll be more and more

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:13.130
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:15.940
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:18.800
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:23.080
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:24.410
Such a waste!

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:27.250
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:30.050
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:22:30.050 --> 00:22:35.650
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.560
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:43.560
Gourmet News, Special Edition!

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:46.500
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:46.900 --> 00:22:49.900
Over 3230 entries!

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:55.670
Thank you so much for all your submissions 
to the Gourmet Monster Contest!

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:58.580
They'll be appearing next episode!

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:02.080
I can't wait to see what 
delicious beasts are coming up!

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:05.020
We've shown just a bit of them here!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:11.760
Summertime means a trip to the Gourmet Beach. And that means a super-sized batch of flavorful ingredients!

00:23:11.760 --> 00:23:14.730
Huh? You mean we don't get to eat the legendary curry this year?

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:17.800
Surpass Dad! Midsummer Gobbling Katsu Curry!

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:19.640
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
